# Local Private Vaults (Keep DesignAcademy Studio public demo, ignore user/client dossiers)
vault/Clients/*
!vault/Clients/DesignAcademy_Studio/
!vault/Clients/.gitkeep

# Never track third-party OAuth tokens. clientCredentialsService writes real
# customer secrets to this filename in plaintext, and the un-ignore above would
# otherwise sweep the demo client's file (and anything later written into it)
# into the repo. This rule sits below the un-ignore so it wins.
vault/**/Credentials.json
vault/Dossiers/*
!vault/Dossiers/DesignAcademy_Studio.md
!vault/Dossiers/.gitkeep
vault/Leads/*
!vault/Leads/lead_jm_901.md
!vault/Leads/lead_jason_miller.md
!vault/Leads/.gitkeep

# Private Local Profiles & Dossier Presets
data/local_profile.json
.claude-flow/
.claude/
apps/orchestrator/data/
apps/orchestrator/vault/



